<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Putnam Intermediate cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Putnam Intermediate cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney downgraded Putnam Intermediate Government Income Trust to neutral from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
